<http://data.silknow.org/object/d76ca137-0bd0-3fd0-8935-44905200a20e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel; large wall panel of silk compound satin; ground, originally blue, now light neutral yellow except a little very pale faded blue in right and bottom border; made of three widths of material (only one is complete); symmetrical, vertical design (not complete) including dogs leaping at goat's head, reclining lions, trophies of war, the huntress Diana, leaping leopards, etc.; woven in taupe and ivory silk wefts; border sewed on all four sides of rinceau with serpents and with heads of lions smoking pipes and caryatids on sides; in each corner, a lion's head; two horizontal seams near top of center; stained, tender, torn,  brittle, faded, partly in shreds, especially right and lower border."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2da6ce6f-e0d2-3dbc-bf06-787f8d8da685> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel; large wall panel of silk compound satin; ground, originally blue, now light neutral yellow except a little very pale faded blue in right and bottom border; made of three widths of material (only one is complete); symmetrical, vertical design (not complete) including dogs leaping at goat's head, reclining lions, trophies of war, the huntress Diana, leaping leopards, etc.; woven in taupe and ivory silk wefts; border sewed on all four sides of rinceau with serpents and with heads of lions smoking pipes and caryatids on sides; in each corner, a lion's head; two horizontal seams near top of center; stained, tender, torn,  brittle, faded, partly in shreds, especially right and lower border."@en ;
